 levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling that reveals history through puzzles, notes, and haunting spaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings that decide whether Cynthia and her friends escape\u2026 or face the origin of the Fog.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/323e69d36727057dbbd9777edcbfc187.poster.avif?t=1759977579\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/323e69d36727057dbbd9777edcbfc187.webm?t=1759977579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/extras/323e69d36727057dbbd9777edcbfc187.mp4?t=1759977579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Cynthia survive Ivayami and uncover the fate of her friends? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice could be her last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Hestios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337980/2ac064dd9b87e46692b4f5c68082784476e4e7da/header.jpg?t=1759977579","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3337980/1718722870/97aef28e9f71fd6d0e66ac2836d010a279b5b429/1759013415/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759374753","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3337980/1718722870/97aef28e9f71fd6d0e66ac2836d010a279b5b429/1759013415/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759374753","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3337980/1718722870/97aef28e9f71fd6d0e66ac2836d010a279b5b429/1759013415/hls_264_ma